    {
      "id": "empty",
      "title": "No rows",
      "titleZh": "没有数据",
      "description": "The empty cell spans the row. It says the fact and leaves the reason to the page that owns the data.",
      "descriptionZh": "空状态那一格横跨整行。它只说事实,原因留给拥有这份数据的页面去写。",
      "markup": "<div class=\"um-virtual-table um-virtual-table--plain\">\n  <div class=\"um-virtual-table__scroller\" role=\"grid\" aria-label=\"Builds\" aria-rowcount=\"0\" aria-colcount=\"3\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"height: 16em;\">\n    <div class=\"um-virtual-table__header\" role=\"row\">\n      <span class=\"um-virtual-table__head-cell\" role=\"columnheader\">Node</span>\n      <span class=\"um-virtual-table__head-cell\" role=\"columnheader\">Build</span>\n      <span class=\"um-virtual-table__head-cell\" role=\"columnheader\">State</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"um-virtual-table__body\" role=\"rowgroup\">\n      <div class=\"um-virtual-table__row um-virtual-table__empty\" role=\"row\">\n        <span class=\"um-virtual-table__cell\" role=\"gridcell\" aria-colspan=\"3\">No builds in the last 24 hours</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The rows are a grid of divs rather than a <table>, and that is what makes the skip possible: a browser will not skip the layout of a table row, because a row is sized by its table. Measured in Chrome 158 on a 200-row table, content-visibility: auto on the <tr> left the table at exactly the height it had without the rule — every row still at its own 30px — while the same rule on a grid of divs left 165 of the 200 rows at their placeholder size. Put on the <td>s it broke the table instead: the rows collapsed from 30px to 9px and the total height changed while the reader scrolled. The header and the rows share one column template, so the names travel with the cells whatever the column count is.",
  "notesZh": "行是用 div 拼的网格而不是 <table>,正是这一点让跳过成为可能:浏览器不会跳过表格行的排版,因为行的大小由表格决定。在 Chrome 158 上量一张 200 行的表,content-visibility: auto 写在 <tr> 上,表的高度和没写这条规则时一模一样 —— 每一行还是它自己的 30px;同一条规则写在一组 div 上,200 行里有 165 行停在那个位置大小上。写在 <td> 上则是把表弄坏了:行高从 30px 塌到 9px,读者滚动的时候整张表的总高度还在变。表头和行共用一套列模板,所以不管有几列,列名都跟着格子走。"
}
